      "fit": 0.85
    },
    {
      "id": "p2",
      "text": "Prominent public voices in the dispute, acting as catalysts for disorder, fueled the cultural controversy by leveling accusations of erasing European history against the steward of canonical narrative's production. This breakdown in social consensus represents a loss of control over the film production activity, a public debate that now demands the restoration of narrative order through a defensive move to reassert a broader heritage vision as shared civilizational heritage.",
